{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1107250-secret-world-legends-free-mmo-like-cofd-universe","id":1107250,"title":"Secret World Legends - Free MMO like CofD universe","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-24T00:49:23-07:00","id":1107250,"title":"Secret World Legends - Free MMO like CofD universe","content":"So on this Monday there is relunch to <b>Secret World</b> story driven game, as free MMO. Motto of the game is <i>Everything Is True</i> - that every myth or legend is true in this world. It's horror genere, playing very much as middle ground between <b>Hunter</b> and <b>Mage</b> - you are person with awakened magical powers that joins one of grand Conspiracies and start to fight powers of Darkness.<br /> <br /> It works more or less like <b>Chronicles of Darkness </b>games, being by RPG fans called as unofficial video game made on the universe. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It even have Tokyo as very important crossover city/location. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Story and quests are very good and inspirational to our favorit RPG settings, so game is worth checking, in my POV.<br /> <br /> Concept trailer, from 6 years ago:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bRY2tRU_OAo\" data-code=\"bRY2tRU_OAo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bRY2tRU_OAo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> And reboot trailer:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OxYICjyFRJY\" data-code=\"OxYICjyFRJY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OxYICjyFRJY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Previous players can transfer they accounts just now if you had one before and play earlier, with us. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Of you are interested in play - we all time looks for gaming buddies. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-24-2017, 04:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T01:11:35-07:00","id":1107256,"title":"","content":"Factions in gameplay are working more or less as Mage Diamond Orders:<ul><li><b>Illuminati</b> plays as Mysterium mixed with Guardians of the Veil ( hell yeah, New York Labyrinth! )</li> <li><b>Templars</b> plays as Adamantine Arrow</li> <li><b>Dragons</b> plays as (specific) Silver Ladder</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"atta